          <div class="cpg-inside-value">

            <p class="cpg-inside-label">
              Why It Matters
            </p>

            <p class="cpg-inside-value__statement">
              Better technology creates better customer journeys and
              makes the platform easier to change as the business evolves.
            </p>

          </div>

        </div>


        <div class="cpg-inside-outcomes">

          <span>Better customer journeys</span>
          <span>Faster releases</span>
          <span>Lower technical debt</span>
          <span>Stronger performance</span>

        </div>


