        <details class="cpg-technical-proof">

          <summary>

            <span>
              View Technical Evidence
            </span>

            <span
              class="cpg-technical-proof__icon"
              aria-hidden="true"
            >
              +
            </span>

          </summary>


          <div class="cpg-technical-proof__content">

            <div class="cpg-technical-proof__intro">

              <div>

                <p class="cpg-inside-label">
                  Architecture
                </p>

                <h3>
                  Lightweight. Server-rendered. Maintainable.
                </h3>

              </div>

              <p>
                CPG.dev uses Node.js, Express and EJS with reusable
                components and shared presentation patterns.
              </p>

            </div>


            <div class="cpg-technical-grid">


              <div class="cpg-technical-card">

                <span>01</span>

                <strong>
                  Node.js
                </strong>

                <small>
                  Application runtime
                </small>

              </div>


              <div class="cpg-technical-card">

                <span>02</span>

                <strong>
                  Express
                </strong>

                <small>
                  Routing and delivery
                </small>

              </div>


              <div class="cpg-technical-card">

                <span>03</span>

                <strong>
                  EJS
                </strong>

                <small>
                  Server-rendered templates
                </small>

              </div>


              <div class="cpg-technical-card">

                <span>04</span>

                <strong>
                  Shared Components
                </strong>

                <small>
                  Consistent UI patterns
                </small>

              </div>

            </div>


            <div class="cpg-technical-note">

              <strong>
                Why a technical reviewer should care:
              </strong>

