            </div>


            <div class="cpg-technical-note">

              <strong>
                Why a technical reviewer should care:
              </strong>

              <p>
                Measurement strategy should define meaningful events,
                acquisition context and outcome signals before those
                data points are transformed into reporting and
                decision systems.
